<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to June 27   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		  10,327.04	   184,754.64</p>
<p>    - sales			 9,848.39	   171,621.13</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)     478.65	    13,133.51</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
